P3-GRACE-001 GREEN

Implementation commit: aa42a665c3af577395b4030534405d560701fe37

Implemented a common process-local DrainGate and wired Spring ContextClosedEvent
drain handling into owner outboxes, inbox bridges, Submission recovery, Search,
Judge, notification, audit, reconciliation, backup, contest and compatibility
workers. Accepted bounded cycles continue; later Redis stream, inbox-row, outbox
and judge-lease claims are refused and remain recoverable through existing PEL,
row-lease and CAS/reaper paths. Spring graceful lifecycle settings, scheduler
await-termination, Docker SIGTERM, Compose stop grace and PM2 kill timeouts are
explicitly configured. Readiness markers are removed while web-less workers
drain.

